{"kind": "mod", "id": 1994, "name": "DLC - Vanilla Fem Clothing", "slug": "dlc-vanilla-fem-clothing", "teaser": "112 Feminine Proportion Reshaped Vanilla Clothing (Non-Replacing)", "owner_name": "Hj", "downloads": 25672, "favourites": 19, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "Creative Commons BY-NC-ND 3.0", "guid": "dlc.femaleclothes", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Clothing", "category_id": 14, "updated_at": "2026-08-08T18:02:41.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-02-02T03:40:21.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-02-02T03:40:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "1.0.3", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/legalcode", "description_html": "<p>DLC - Vanilla Fem Clothing</p>\n<p>This mod gives your PMC a more feminine appearance.</p>\n<p>Almost all vanilla clothing has been reshaped to fit a more feminine body type.</p>\n<p>Unfortunately, female heads are not included—yet!</p>\n<p><strong>WUVGAWORE :</strong> Just to clarify a few things, this is a project that I made and gave upon after losing interest in SPT; Hjal luckily chose to update and publish it instead of letting it sit in dust but, it was only 50% done when I stopped making SPT mods. Here’s what’s included and what’s missing.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>112 (Non-Replacing) Reshaped USEC, BEAR, SCAV clothing found under Ragman&gt;Services</li>\n<li>1 Universally used placeholder first person view gloves, this means that every top included in the mod does not have it’s matching gloves but instead a placeholder one as I never got around to changing them to the default gloves or modeling my own</li>\n<li>0 Boss outfits</li>\n<li>0 New Heads</li>\n<li>Color will be slightly darker as I couldn’t replicate the vanilla materials 1:1</li>\n<li>I wanted realistic proportions that wouldn’t take away from the vanilla game, meaning non-gooner and very subtle</li>\n</ul>\